  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Returns the vector that is the geometric center of the object <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Viewer_coordinate_frames#Local" target="_blank">relative</a> to the root prim.</p>
</p>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
